        "review_body": "I am extremely disappointed with my overall experience.\n\nI placed an order for three items and paid using both a gift card and another form of payment. I only needed to return one item, the gray blouse.\n\nWhen I contacted customer service, I was initially told that I could receive my refund as a gift card. Later, I was told that this was not possible because I had used a gift card toward the original purchase, even though the order was not paid for entirely with a gift card. Receiving conflicting information from customer service was frustrating and left me with very little confidence in the process.\n\nThe biggest issue, however, was the return shipping cost. When I went to complete the return, I discovered it would cost nearly $14 to return a shirt that cost only $22. At that point, returning the item simply did not make financial sense. A return policy should give customers confidence when making a purchase—not leave them feeling forced to keep merchandise because the cost of returning it is so high.\n\nThis experience has left me feeling that your return policy is not customer-friendly. Between the inconsistent information from customer service and the excessive return shipping cost, this has been one of the most disappointing online shopping experiences I have had.\n\nI hope this feedback is taken seriously. I would encourage your company to review both its return policy and the consistency of the information being provided by customer service representatives. Unfortunately, this experience has significantly reduced my confidence in shopping with your company again.\n\nKrista Day ",
